{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんは!\n \n \n 本日は名古屋で個別握手会でした!\n \n 黒い羊の個別握手会は本日が初日でした〜\n \n お集まり頂いた皆さん、\n ありがとうございました!!\n \n ちょっと寒かったので温かくして\n 寝てくださいね☺️風邪ひかない様に。\n \n \n \n \n \n 今回の名古屋では、\n 約束通り、レーンで卒業制作展もしました!\n \n 本当に作った写真集はもっとボリューミー\n なのだけど、今回Ver.に再構成し直して\n 展示致しました!\n \n \n 皆さんへの、せめてもの感謝と、\n これからのよろしくね を込めた展示です\n \n \n 今日、すごく沢山感想を頂いたり\n お褒めのお言葉を頂けて嬉しかったです!\n \n \n また次の個握でもやりたいな〜なんて\n 考えてます🤔\n \n \n \n \n お楽しみに!\n \n \n \n \n \n \n お花もいっぱいありがとう🙂\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNPSR5T9W86J7YFH63FH0H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNPTQPBY9PNRG9QGY9776N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNPVRK1WC6KFA322876QP4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNPWTH9FJT12R82VD3ERKN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNPXWBC0NNN6G4DKF175SX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNPYWEBX8XPDYQM73GP1EK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNPZW3A37VA4W4FBJJXC15","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNQ0XYY4GN3R6HH3E2XVMZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNQ1WJ1F2QN4QF8A8GBQQ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \